1. Project Overview / Scope Summary
Business Requirement
The Omega Migration initiative aims to onboard and migrate DART support data metrics from Omega source systems to Core source systems as part of the post go-live/cutover onboarding activities.
Scope Summary
Migration and remapping of Omega metrics to Core source metrics
Updates to impacted DART metric tables
Validation and regression testing for impacted reports and dashboards
Alignment of metric mappings with business-approved Core logic
